  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">R&#xE9;ponse d&#x2019;urgence aux besoins humanitaires des communaut&#xE9;s Agro-pastoraux affect&#xE9;es par la crise du Soudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide food security - agriculture assistance to host communities affected in Ouaddai, Assoungha, Kimiti. This FAO project distributes vegetable seeds of improved varieties with high yield and high nutritional value to improve the nutrition of host households already affected by climatic hazards. This project provides humanitarian assistance to 12,000 people, including 8,400 women, 1,200 children, and including 500 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
